{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Hidden IC Channels","id":"867300973532938280","name":"secret-cove-shipping","position":182,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"They exhale lightly. \"How narrowly or loosely does one define 'this'?\" they grin","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:28:59.241000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451281952030751","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"The smuggling thing.\" The nameless replies plainly.","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:29:34.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451430765932595","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"This kinda smuggling, not too long, only a little before the british came. As for smuggling in general, well we used to get up to all kinds of mischief before we came here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:31:10.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451834073423912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"The nameless chuckles quietly. \"You two ever fought much?\" His mind still flowing with memories of recent events.","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:31:51.995000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869452006534832179","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Trapero bursts out laughing. \"All the time, friend. All the time. We're basically the same person and drive each other nuts for it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:33:51.621000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869452508282638366","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"How are you guys still working together if your drive each other nuts then? Shouldn't relationships be smooth?\" He asks naively.","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:34:58.482000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869452788717994014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"At this, Trapero has to set down their crate they're laughing so hard. They sit down on it and indicate for you to do the same. \"How old are you, nameless speaker?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:36:01.101000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869453051361124383","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"Barely over my first century.\" The nameless replies as he takes a seat.","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:36:23.333000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869453144608870460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"Ah, so still a child then.\" They sigh, as if remembering something. \"Nothing's ever going to be perfect. No relationship's ever going to be smooth or easy. it's all going to be hard and you're going to have to fight for it. And sometimes that looks like fighting each other, sometimes it looks like fighting someone else together, sometimes it looks like making stupid mistakes. But if a relationship is perfectly smooth, you're not risking anything. And if you don't play, you can't win. You just break even forever, and that's no way to be.\" They sit for a minute before smiling and going back to work","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:40:17.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869454125841129532","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"The nameless takes a moment to digest what Trapero said.","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:41:40.586000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869454475264393257","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"He understands slightly. \"It's just so hard.\" He replies as he resumes working as well. \"Everything's fine for one second and then it all comes crashing down.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:42:12.242000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869454608039301182","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Trapero nods. \"I know the feeling. Pros and I were riding high, the top of our game. We were the best trickster in all of the wyld. And then we lost it all.\" They shrug, making you think this event was likely up to several centuries ago. \"But here we are. And i'd gladly lose it all again just for another chance to fuck up those uptight bastards in red. It's gonna suck. But it's also gonna get a hell of a lot better.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:45:54.019000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869455538239447091","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"I'll have to take you at your word then.\" The nameless tries for a weak smile. \"But for now, things suck, and I'll wallow in sadness for just a bit.\" He gives a wistful look.","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:47:44.716000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869456002536337448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"They nod. \"Wallow away, my friend. No harm in that so long as you still do what you can to get done what needs doing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:48:38.446000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869456227896274944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"Depressed revolutionaries still win wars.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:49:01.497000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869456324579196948","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"Exactly why I'm here boss.\" The nameless gives a small grin and continues to work, feeling a bit better from the conversation.","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:49:22.112000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869456411044745286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
