{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"Gotcha. It was fun doing this, it helped me think about things, so thanks for that.\" The nameless says as he smiles at Trapero.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:03:15.011000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869459904476348456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"They nod, before conjuring a shard of shadow into their palm and flipping it absentmindedly. \"Stay safe out there, kid.\" they grin before dissapearing into shadow and out of sight.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:05:01.739000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869460352126058506","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"The nameless leaves the cove and heads over to the <#852739008332431372>.","created_at":"2021-07-27T06:06:02.156000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869460605533306930","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
