{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Trapero can be seen here, pouring over what looks like an extremely complex schematic. They turn to you, startled. \"Ah, the speaker with no name. What appears to be the problem?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:39:54.821000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869786220530659398","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"Redcoats!\" The nameless says. \"A pair of them... rowing... in.. grassy bay bleed.\" He lets out the words in between deep breaths.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:41:00.196000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869786494733275227","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"Trapero nods. \"They won't find us. And i don't think they expect to yet.\" They look to you.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:44:07.152000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869787278883561603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
