{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"They nod slowly to themselves and look out to the northwest. \"You wouldn't happen to know exactly what's the matter in the noir, would you? Strightest answer we could get from a messenger was something about wolves?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:46:42.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869787930732929044","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
